# This dir holds PRIVATE git config includes (work identity, etc.) loaded by
# ~/.gitconfig via includeIf directives.
#
# Track the folder itself (via this file) so it always exists after stow, but
# ignore every other file so private identities are never accidentally committed.
# README.md and work.config.example are whitelisted: tracked docs/template.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!work.config.example
